try":"COG","lat":-4.80537,"lon":11.859,"kind":"region","bbox":[11.8202,-4.8552,11.8982,-4.7415],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[11.8862,-4.8552],[11.8202,-4.7848],[11.8484,-4.786],[11.8417,-4.7415],[11.8982,-4.7418],[11.8862,-4.8552]]]}}],"cities":[{"id":"city-1159150993","name":"布拉柴维尔","country":"COG","lat":-4.25724,"lon":15.28274,"kind":"city","region":"CG-12","rank":3,"capital":1,"knowledge":{"theme":"布拉柴维尔 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"布拉柴维尔（法语：，；刚果语：），又译布拉札维，位于刚果共和国南部刚果河畔的斯坦利湖北岸，与刚果民主共和国首都金沙萨隔河相望。\n布拉柴维尔位于赤道以南，距大西洋506公里。\n市区地形较为平坦，海拔317米，周围是广阔的稀树草原。","culture":"布拉柴维尔始建于1880年9月10日，由法籍意大利探险家皮埃尔·萨沃尼昂·德·布拉柴建立；这一天，当地的马科科（Makoko）国王与之签署协议，将其王国置于法国的保护之下；四年后，为与河对岸比利时人兴建的利奥波德维尔（今金沙萨）竞争，城市开始兴建。\n第三区，也是最老的区之一，建于1900年左右，原为沼泽和奥基拉村（Okila）。","see":"刚果圣安娜大教堂建于1949年，位于1944年兴建的菲利克斯·埃布埃体育场附近，二者均为罗歇·埃雷尔设计，是城市象征性建筑。\n这里也是重要的河港，拥有通往金沙萨和途径因普丰多至班吉的渡船，但由于下游朱埃河汇入刚果河处有李文斯顿瀑布，因此无法航行至大西洋。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q3844","articleTitle":"布拉柴维尔","sourceRevision":93416231,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 布拉柴维尔","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%83%E6%8B%89%E6%9F%B4%E7%BB%B4%E5%B0%94"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93416231"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3844"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159150031","name":"卡耶斯","country":"COG","lat":-4.18002,"lon":13.28001,"kind":"city","region":"CG-11","rank":4,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159150171","name":"黑角","country":"COG","lat":-4.77001,"lon":11.88004,"kind":"city","region":"CG-5","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"黑角 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"城市坐落在黑角湾和大西洋之间的一个海角上。\n当地黑人又称之为“Ponton”（美人）或“Ndindji”（建城之前位于此地的小村庄名）。\n该地气候湿热，九、十月雨量较少；全年平均气温23.8°C-30°C，夜间平均气温22°C-26°C。","culture":"第一家医院建于1936年，同年西非银行在这里开设了第一家分行。\n宗教信仰方面，天主教徒占58%，无神论和不可知论者27%，非洲本地宗教11%，穆斯林2%。","see":"海滩风景秀丽且适于冲浪，南部的迪奥索（Diosso）峡谷和南加（Nanga）湖也是不错的景点。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q223920","articleTitle":"黑角","sourceRevision":94492430,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 黑角","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%91%E8%A7%92"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94492430"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q223920"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148591","name":"韋索","country":"COG","lat":1.60999,"lon":16.05002,"kind":"city","region":"CG-13","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159141667","name":"埃沃","country":"COG","lat":-0.8796,"lon":14.82001,"kind":"city","region":"CG-15","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159142165","name":"因普丰多","country":"COG","lat":1.64038,"lon":18.04002,"kind":"city","region":"CG-7","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159142169","name":"森贝","country":"COG","lat":1.64038,"lon":14.58003,"kind":"city","region":"CG-13","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159142173","name":"莫伦杜","country":"COG","lat":2.03374,"lon":15.21668,"kind":"city","region":"CG-13","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159142999","name":"奥旺多","country":"COG","lat":-0.47962,"lon":15.92,"kind":"city","region":"CG-8","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159143005","name":"馬夸","country":"COG","lat":-0.00957,"lon":15.64002,"kind":"city","region":"CG-8","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159143009","name":"錫比提","country":"COG","lat":-3.68961,"lon":13.35003,"kind":"city","region":"CG-2","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159143013","name":"莫森焦","country":"COG","lat":-2.93963,"lon":12.71999,"kind":"city","region":"CG-9","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159143017","name":"多利西","country":"COG","lat":-4.1796,"lon":12.67002,"kind":"city","region":"CG-9","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"ci